  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FIGAP Gender Action Plan basket funding</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FIGAP Gender Action Plan basket funding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att givarna gemensamt st&#xf6;dja genomf&#xf6;randet av den nationella handlingsplan f&#xf6;r j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet, f&#xf6;r att bidra till &#xf6;kad j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet  i Bosnien och Hercegovina. Detta ska ske genom: att st&#xe4;rka            j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsinstitutioner, partner org s, lagstiftning f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar och genomf&#xf6;ra konkreta j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsrelaterade projekt, eller         engendering befintliga institutionella projekt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is that donors jointly support implementation of the national gender action plan, in order to contribute to improved gender         equality in BiH. This shall be done through: strengthening gender     institutions, partner org&apos;s, legislation improvements, and            implementation of concrete gender-related projects, or engendering    existing institutional projects.</narrative>
  </description>
